head for future tokens?* **CoRR**, abs/2404.00859.","url":"https://openreview.net/pdf?id=sj15Gn7GJh"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.reddit.com","ref_id":"turn2reddit19","snippet":"\"Do language models plan ahead for future tokens?.\" arXiv preprint arXiv:2404.00859 (2024).—\"*the model learns to prepare hidden states that ... The core of every GPT","title":"Chat models aren’t trained to predict the next token.","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/aiwars/comments/1l6u1rk"}]}}
