{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The reading points to two controls we’ll need: a model can leak by conspicuously avoiding a secret, and a secret-aware outline can contain clues before prose generation starts. I’ll separate those effects in the design. The closest paper’s code link is redacted, but its word lists and prompts are available in the PDF.\n"}}
