{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_47","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"ls notes/rendered/2605.28639_chunk_001.png && cat > planning.md <<'EOF'\n# Research direction budget and experiment handoff\n\n## Scope and ranking (Phase 1, 2026-10-04)\nQuestion: does supplying an outline reduce unintended information about a secret in a story, and is a causally relevant secret representation responsible? Distinguish arbitrary secret words from future plot revelations. Scores 1–5; total = evidence + hypothesis relevance + information gain + feasibility (equal weights). These are reasoned priorities, not measured outcomes.\n\n| Rank | Direction | Evidence | Relevance | Gain | Feasibility | Total | Decision |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\n|1|Matched outline vs no-outline behavioral experiment|5|5|5|5|20|Keep D1|\n|2|Layer/time secret decoding across outline conditions|5|5|4|4|18|Keep D2|\n|3|Targeted activation intervention with quality and recall controls|4|5|5|3|17|Keep D3|\n|4|Private-memory multi-agent architecture|4|3|3|3|13|Prune: different retention problem, extra architecture confounds|\n|5|Broad model scaling survey|4|3|2|2|11|Prune: closest leakage paper already covers scale; use only pilot size check|\n|6|Fine-tune/myopic pretraining to disentangle planning|4|4|2|1|11|Prune: costly training, less direct than randomized outlines|\n|7|Adversarial secret extraction benchmark|5|2|1|3|11|Prune: adversary-induced disclosure differs from involuntary leakage|\n|8|Optimize literary quality/suspense as main objective|4|2|2|3|11|Prune: quality is a control, not primary leakage outcome|\n\nEvidence: Holtzman & West 2605.10794 motivates D1; DOC 2212.10077 and Xie/Riedl 2402.17119 establish useful but potentially hint-producing outlines. Cywiński 2510.01070, Ramnauth/Scassellati 2605.28639 and Dong 2502.06258 support D2. Concise-SAE 2505.16505, CI-Steering 2604.00209 and Hanna/Ameisen 2604.12493 support D3. Wu 2404.00859 warns against inferring planning from prediction.\n\nNovelty refinement during initial Phase 1 screening: D2 alone is not novel (suppressed concepts already decoded); its value is the plan-conditioned time trajectory and its connection to D3. Rankings unchanged. No extra implementation directions authorized by this plan.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
